    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> the Emanation follows you; any creature it moves into, or that enters it or ends its turn there, makes the save (once a turn). <strong>The creatures you target before casting are the ones you designate</strong>: they are never affected (the cast's target condition <code>!target.chosen</code>). The halved Speed is not automated. It changes no item: midi applies it to any item with the identifier <code>spirit-guardians</code> (2024 rules) that nothing else automates.</p>",
